<title>UK: Credit Local sets 150 mln Sfr bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local sets 150 mln Sfr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CSFB Zurich.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.125     MATURITY    01.OCT.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.50    PAY DATE   S01.APR.97</p>
<p> PAY FREQ   ANNUAL    LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   14.MAR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   DENOMS (K) 5	   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE IS A REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
